          "alias": "林中相拥",
          "prompt": "2girls,in a secluded grove deep within a forest,where sunlight filters down in warm,hazy shafts through the dense emerald canopy,girl holds girl in a tender embrace. the light dapples the forest floor,illuminating floating dust motes and creating an ethereal glow around them,isolating them in a pocket of profound quietude. her usual sharp demeanor softened by an intense,protective tenderness,leans down to press a soft,lingering kiss on girl's forehead.girl,cradled securely in her arms,appears serene with her eyes closed and a soft,contented smile gracing her lips,fully immersed in the warm intimacy of the moment. her light-colored,nature-themed attire seems to absorb the gentle light,while girl's darker clothing provides a contrasting depth. the air is still and warm,filled only with the distant,muted sounds of the forest,heightening the sense of a private world shared only by them. the scene is suffused with a gentle,almost sacred intimacy,hinting at a deep,complex bond that flourishes in ther sun-kissed,hidden sanctuary.",
