        {
          "id": "codex-suozhang-4049",
          "alias": "草地私会",
          "prompt": "1boy,1girl,cowboy shot,lying on grass,from above,smile,In a secluded grove deep within a forest,where sunlight filters down in warm,hazy shafts through the dense emerald canopy,boy holds girl in a tender embrace. The light dapples the forest floor,illuminating floating dust motes and creating an ethereal glow around them,isolating them in a pocket of profound quietude.the boy,his usual sharp demeanor softened by an intense,protective tenderness,leans down to press a soft,lingering kiss on girl's forehead.\ngirl,cradled securely in his arms,appears serene with her eyes closed and a soft,contented smile gracing her lips,fully immersed in the warm intimacy of the moment. Her light-colored,nature-themed attire seems to absorb the gentle light,while boy's darker clothing provides a contrasting depth. The air is still and warm,filled only with the distant,muted sounds of the forest,heightening the sense of a private world shared only by them. The scene is suffused with a gentle,almost sacred intimacy,hinting at a deep,complex bond that flourishes in this sun-kissed,hidden sanctuary.\nphotographic reference,photo background,3d background,3D render,3DCG,\n3::cinematic angle,cinematic lighting::,3::lens flare::,\nhighly finished,Character Study,amazing quality,absurdres,best quality,white flower field,foreshortening,blurry foreground,",
          "description": "",
