        {
          "id": "docx-n5-f9d4f672911040dd71b9234d",
          "alias": "橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）",
          "prompt": "Tono Hanna and Tachibana Sherry are flying high above Tokyo city on a broomstick,seen from a dramatic bird’s-eye view with a strong sense of height,speed,and depth. The composition is dynamic and cinematic rather than flat,with the broom flying diagonally across the frame and the two girls placed slightly off-center. They are shown at a moderate distance,small enough for the vast city below to feel enormous,but still close enough for their poses,silhouettes,and main outfit features to remain recognizable. Tono Hanna sits at the front of the broom,leaning forward and gripping it with both hands as she controls the flight. Her long pale-blonde twin tails,ribbons,and the layered frills of her green,black,and white floral dress stream backward in the wind.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_11785_橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）.jpg",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
