        {
          "id": "docx-n5-fd1a6101e39121d1438c5d35",
          "alias": "橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）",
          "prompt": "Tachibana Sherry sits directly behind Tono Hanna,holding Tono Hanna with one arm around her waist while pointing her other hand forward in the direction of flight. Her short blue hair,small dark hat,blue-toned outfit,cape-like outer layer,and skirt are lifted by the wind,adding motion and energy to the scene. Their bodies follow the forward direction of the broom,creating a clear feeling of fast movement through the sky rather than a still floating pose.",
