        {
          "id": "docx-n5-73d6b24383973c3211b745dd",
          "alias": "橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）",
          "prompt": "The space around them has rich layering and atmosphere. Thin clouds and drifting mist pass in front of and behind the girls,with some clouds partially crossing the broom or the lower part of their bodies,creating a stronger sense of altitude and depth. Far below,the huge urban sprawl of Tokyo city stretches endlessly across the frame,filled with dense buildings,roads,and blocks of city structure. Tokyo Tower is clearly visible and more prominent within the cityscape,acting as an important visual landmark rather than a tiny distant detail. The city gradually fades into pale bluish haze in the distance,while the sky remains bright,airy,and luminous.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_11787_橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）.jpg",
          "tags": [],
