        {
          "id": "docx-n5-d450d059c1cee10adf836418",
          "alias": "橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）",
          "prompt": "The overall color palette is soft but vivid,combining the fresh green and white tones of Tono Hanna,the cool blue tones of Tachibana Sherry,the pale blue sky,and the gray-blue city below. The contrast between the colorful girls and the slightly muted city helps the characters stand out,while the clouds,wind,diagonal composition,and vast aerial view make the scene feel adventurous,magical,and visually rich.",
