        {
          "id": "docx-n5-219d8176207a8a78a808bd0a",
          "alias": "互相踢踏的打闹",
          "prompt": "on the left,a girl continues walking uphill with both hands folded loosely behind her back,apparently unaware of what is about to happen. her posture is upright and unhurried,with one brown loafer placed ahead of the other. an ahoge rises above a brown beret decorated with a black bow. her very long white hair is divided into two thick braids that hang down her back and sway outward with her stride. she wears a loose white long-sleeved coat over a white shirt and black striped bowtie,a grey grid-and-plaid skirt,black thigh-high stockings and brown loafers. the coat tails and braids overlap naturally across her back,shifting with the warm breeze.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "lib_lib2_11790_互相踢踏的打闹.jpg",
          "tags": [],
