          "prompt": "Tono Hanna and Tachibana Sherry are flying high above Tokyo city on a broomstick,seen from a dramatic bird’s-eye view with a strong sense of height,speed,and depth. The composition is dynamic and cinematic rather than flat,with the broom flying diagonally across the frame and the two girls placed slightly off-center. They are shown at a moderate distance,small enough for the vast city below to feel enormous,but still close enough for their poses,silhouettes,and main outfit features to remain recognizable. Tono Hanna sits at the front of the broom,leaning forward and gripping it with both hands as she controls the flight. Her long pale-blonde twin tails,ribbons,and the layered frills of her green,black,and white floral dress stream backward in the wind.\nTachibana Sherry sits directly behind Tono Hanna,holding Tono Hanna with one arm around her waist while pointing her other hand forward in the direction of flight. Her short blue hair,small dark hat,blue-toned outfit,cape-like outer layer,and skirt are lifted by the wind,adding motion and energy to the scene. Their bodies follow the forward direction of the broom,creating a clear feeling of fast movement through the sky rather than a still floating pose.\nThe space around them has rich layering and atmosphere. Thin clouds and drifting mist pass in front of and behind the girls,with some clouds partially crossing the broom or the lower part of their bodies,creating a stronger sense of altitude and depth. Far below,the huge urban sprawl of Tokyo city stretches endlessly across the frame,filled with dense buildings,roads,and blocks of city structure. Tokyo Tower is clearly visible and more prominent within the cityscape,acting as an important visual landmark rather than a tiny distant detail. The city gradually fades into pale bluish haze in the distance,while the sky remains bright,airy,and luminous.\nThe overall color palette is soft but vivid,combining the fresh green and white tones of Tono Hanna,the cool blue tones of Tachibana Sherry,the pale blue sky,and the gray-blue city below. The contrast between the colorful girls and the slightly muted city helps the characters stand out,while the clouds,wind,diagonal composition,and vast aerial view make the scene feel adventurous,magical,and visually rich.\nlooking afar,looking at another,smile,happy,\nsidesaddle,sitting,broom riding,wind,dynamic pose,afloat,floating hair,Tachibana Sherry hugs Tono Hanna from behind.",
          "description": "来源：所长N5常规NovelAI个人法典；版本：2026.9.25\n\nhttps://novelai.quicktagcloud.com/?c=suozhang_nai5&id=suozhang_nai5-0047",
