        {
          "id": "codex-suozhang_nai5-0048",
          "alias": "互相踢踏的打闹",
          "prompt": "a wide anime illustration viewed from behind at eye level,showing two girls walking away along a gently rising residential lane on a bright summer afternoon. they occupy the lower centre of the frame as small full-body figures,surrounded by dense green trees,pale utility poles and distant buildings softened by humid sunlight.\non the left,a girl continues walking uphill with both hands folded loosely behind her back,apparently unaware of what is about to happen. her posture is upright and unhurried,with one brown loafer placed ahead of the other. an ahoge rises above a brown beret decorated with a black bow. her very long white hair is divided into two thick braids that hang down her back and sway outward with her stride. she wears a loose white long-sleeved coat over a white shirt and black striped bowtie,a grey grid-and-plaid skirt,black thigh-high stockings and brown loafers. the coat tails and braids overlap naturally across her back,shifting with the warm breeze.\nto her right,a short blue-haired girl performs a playful sideways kick while still moving forward. she balances on her right foot with that knee slightly bent,tilts her upper body away to counterbalance the motion,and extends her left leg horizontally behind the white-haired girl. the sole and rounded toe of her brown loafer make light contact with the centre of the other girl’s skirt-covered backside. her hips rotate into the kick while both arms tuck behind her back in an exaggerated attempt to look innocent. she turns her face sideways toward her companion,blue eyes watching closely and her mouth curled into a mischievous smile.\nthe blue-haired girl wears a short-sleeved white serafuku with a blue sailor collar and blue neckerchief,a blue pleated skirt,white knee-high socks and brown loafers. her lifted skirt pleats,neckerchief and short hair react to the quick motion,while her planted shoe remains firmly aligned with the sloping pavement.\ncapture the precise comic instant of contact: the white-haired girl’s upper body has only just begun to pitch forward,one braid bouncing upward and her beret shifting slightly,while the blue-haired girl remains poised on one leg. their overlapping silhouettes make the action immediately readable from behind.\nlarge leafy branches frame the upper corners and cast irregular patches of sun and shade across the road. a white wire fence,glimpses of apartment façades,flowering shrubs and striped safety markings on a utility pole establish a quiet japanese neighbourhood. the brightest opening lies farther uphill between the trees,drawing the girls forward. use saturated summer greens,cool blue shadows and warm dappled highlights,with the playful kick as the clear centre of the scene",
          "description": "来源：所长N5常规NovelAI个人法典；版本：2026.9.25\n\nhttps://novelai.quicktagcloud.com/?c=suozhang_nai5&id=suozhang_nai5-0048",
